OL,3,AAlleged sexual assault by local
OL,4,Aofficial and businessman sparks outrage
OL,5,Ain China
OL,6,
OL,7,FChinese authorities have arrested a
OL,8,Flocal government official and a
OL,9,Fbusinessman suspected of sexually
OL,10,Fassaulting a woman at a business
OL,11,Fgathering, in a case that has sparked
OL,12,Foutrage in the country.
OL,14,FThe woman was allegedly assaulted at a
OL,15,Fkaraoke bar in Hangzhou after an
OL,16,Fofficial dinner involving executives
OL,17,Ffrom several companies and officials.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
