OL,3,AAlleged sexual assault by local
OL,4,Aofficial and businessman sparks outrage
OL,5,Ain China
OL,6,
OL,7,FLocal authorities said an investigation
OL,8,Fhad found the woman was sexually
OL,9,Fassaulted by both men, adding that she
OL,10,Fhad been pushed to the ground by one of
OL,11,Fthem, causing injuries to her lower
OL,12,Fback.
OL,14,FBoth suspects in the case have been
OL,15,Fdismissed from their positions, the
OL,16,Fstatement added.
